            "review_title": "Review at Della Seta Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Anh Q\nHanoi, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nDelightful Evening\nSep 2018 • Couples\nWe had a great meal in Della yesterday!\n\nFirst of all, the restaurant had a really unique, modern yet warm and friendly way of decorating. \n\nWe used the dinner set and ordered some soups & porcini pasta to go along with. \n\nThe mushroom soup was light seasoned but that was perfect for our palate to get ready for the main courses. \n\nI ordered my steak medium rare, and it was near to perfection. It was cooked right, perfectly seasoned. However, the silver skin was not cleared properly which caused some bites to be quite chewy. \n\nThe pizza was fresh, delicious and all I could ask for. Perfect! \n\nWe were quite full up until this point, but to our surprise, the Porcini pasta was out of this world. Props to the kitchen team. Everything about this dish was just right. Love the flavor, especially the freshness of the mushroom by which I can tell how Della take care of it's ingredients.\n\nWe did not enjoy the Passion panna cotta too much. Perhalfs we were too full already.\n\nOverall, we love the foods, which is why, despite of how many dishes we ordered, there was no left over :)\n\nTo top it all up, Trang was a great waitress. She was polite, quick and tentative.\n\nP/s: all runners in Della seem to wear really nice Adidas sneakers. \n\nDefenitely will come back again,\nAnh\nRead more\nWritten September 2, 2018",
